<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Employment Recived</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; margin: 20px;
      padding: 20px; background-color: #f8f8f8; } .container { background-color:
      #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0,
      0, 0.1); } .body { text-align:center; } .logo { width: 100px; } .qr-code{
      width: 300px; } .note { font-size: 13px; } .footer { margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 12px; color: #777; } .table-box{ text-align: center; } table {
      width: 500px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; margin:0 auto 10px; } th,td {
      text-align: left; border: 0px; outline: 0px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='body'>
        <div class='logo-box'>
          <img class='logo' src='{{logoPath}}' alt='' />
        </div>
        <h2>Payment Successfully Completed</h2>
        <table>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Registration No</strong></td>
              <td>{{body.reg_no}}</td>
              <td><strong>Name</strong></td>
              <td>{{body.name}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Phone No</strong></td>
              <td>{{body.phone}}</td>
              <td><strong>Date Of Birth</strong></td>
              <td>{{body.dob}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>State</strong></td>
              <td colspan='3'>{{body.state}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Address</strong></td>
              <td colspan='3'>{{body.address}}</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <img src='{{body.qrcode}}' class='qr-code' />
        <p class='note'>
          To complete the verification process, please send your employer to one
          of our offices with the QR code above to capture their fingerprints
          and photo.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p>If you have any further questions, feel free to reach out.</p>
      <p>Best regards,<br />Base</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>